# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for CI. Loaded with
#   TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=.github/sanitizers/tsan.supp
#
# Known defect, tracked in issue #9 and to be fixed in the code, not here:
# fsys::stat() (src/fsys.cpp) calls getpwuid() and getgrgid() from the
# worker threads. Both return pointers into a static buffer that is not
# thread-safe; getpwuid_r/getgrgid_r are the reentrant forms. Remove these
# two lines when stat() stops using the non-reentrant calls.
race:getpwuid
race:getgrgid
